
## `.gitignore` Configuration

Save the following block as `.gitignore` in the root directory of the project:


# Python
*__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.local
.env.staging
.env.production
.coverage
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Cryptographic Keys (NEVER commit RSA keys)
backend/private.pem
backend/public.pem

# Node / NuxtJS
node_modules/
.nuxt/
.output/
.data/
dist/
frontend/.env
frontend/.env.local
frontend/.env.staging
frontend/.env.production
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
dist/
build/
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.env
.env.local
# Docker volumes
data/postgres/
data/redis/

# OS / IDE Specific
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/settings.json
*.swp

backend/private.pem
backend/public.pem
backend/.env.local
frontend/.env.local

